sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser
  participant T as TanStack server
  participant S as Supabase
  participant P as Local FastAPI
  participant M as Local model
  U->>B: Invoke AI control
  B->>B: Require AI-ready session
  B->>T: Request plus bearer token
  T->>S: Verify claims and resource ownership
  S-->>T: claims.sub and owned context
  T->>P: Contract request plus bearer and X-Student-Id cross-check
  P->>P: Verify JWT and validate input
  P->>S: RLS-scoped context/data read
  P->>M: Local inference
  M-->>P: Untrusted model output
  P->>P: Validate and attach provenance
  P-->>T: Typed result or bounded error
  T->>S: Persist only authorized real result
  T-->>B: Stream or normalized response
  B-->>U: Success, retry or unavailable state
